 "description": "The First 53 is a high-performance cruiser that sails exceptionally well and lives up to the expectations of sailors who refuse to choose between performance and comfort.\nDesigned for experienced sailors who know exactly what they want, she delivers a well-balanced hull, unique sensations at the helm, and an easy-flow deck plan. Her modern interior — white lacquered bulkheads and warm moulded wood — feels elegant and complete.",
